{"code":"014100","name":"메디앙스","market":"KOSDAQ","sector_name":"화장품","sector_desc":"화장품 제조(ODM 포함)와 브랜드. 중국·미국 등 수출 채널과 면세 수요에 민감합니다.","desc":"동사는 1979년 설립되어 1995년 코스닥에 상장하고 2020년 메디앙스로 상호 변경하였음. 유아 토털문화기업으로 스킨케어, 수유용품, 패션 등 다양한 육아 제품을 제공하고 있으며 주요 브랜드로 Dr.ato, B&B, 더퓨어를 보유하고 있음. 올곧은 육아 캠페인을 통해 제품 품질을 개선하고 2020년 중국 법인 설립을 통해 글로벌 생활문화기업으로 성장하고 있음.","f":{"date":"2026-10-27","n_days":299,"close":1636.0,"open":1630.0,"high":1675.0,"low":1531.0,"volume":11088,"amount":18139968.0,"ret_1d":0.2451,"gap":-0.1225,"range_pct":8.802,"ret_5":-2.619,"ret_20":4.4033,"ret_60":-12.1846,"ret_120":-8.8579,"ret_250":-17.0385,"ma20":1628.65,"ma60":1701.2667,"ma120":1682.275,"ma200":1687.145,"close_vs_ma200":-3.0315,"close_vs_ma60":-3.8364,"ma_align":0,"cross_ma200_20d":0.0,"slope_60":-49.8538,"r2_60":0.5677,"slope_120":5.1233,"r2_120":0.0093,"slope_250":-8.1664,"r2_250":0.1415,"high52":2125.0,"low52":1126.0,"pos_52w":51.0511,"dd_52w":-23.0118,"mdd_1y":-32.066,"atr14_pct":6.5709,"vol_ann_60":42.4294,"vol_avg20":31648.15,"vol_ratio20":0.3504,"vr5":0.4176,"vr20":1.0286,"amount_avg5":21387435.8,"amount_avg20":51724354.05,"amount_avg60":48446303.4167,"obv_chg20":13.7327,"turnover_20":5.3641,"pv_eff_20":0.8209,"rsi14":48.9047,"frgn_net_5":-2786.0,"inst_net_5":0.0,"frgn_net_5_pct":-0.0236,"inst_net_5_pct":0.0,"smart_net_5_pct":-0.0236,"frgn_net_20":4278.0,"inst_net_20":-957.0,"frgn_net_20_pct":0.0363,"inst_net_20_pct":-0.0081,"smart_net_20_pct":0.0281,"frgn_net_60":153.0,"inst_net_60":0.0,"frgn_net_60_pct":0.0013,"inst_net_60_pct":0.0,"smart_net_60_pct":0.0013,"frgn_net_120":26090.0,"inst_net_120":-390.0,"frgn_net_120_pct":0.2211,"inst_net_120_pct":-0.0033,"smart_net_120_pct":0.2178,"foreign_ratio":1.93,"foreign_ratio_chg_60":-0.08,"smart_buy_streak":1,"op_income_q":-13.0,"op_margin_q":-9.2857,"op_qoq":-200.0,"op_turnaround":0.0,"op_yoy":-262.5,"rev_yoy":0.7194,"op_trend_4q":21.8182,"fin_period":"202606","roe":-0.8,"debt_ratio":59.36,"per":null,"pbr":0.27,"div_yield":null,"foreign_rate":1.91,"t